## docker-compose Discovery

Before creating a new `docker-compose.yml`, search for an existing one:
```bash
find . -maxdepth 4 \( -name "docker-compose*.yml" -o -name "docker-compose*.yaml" \) 2>/dev/null
```
- Found → extend it, do not replace
- Not found → create with full stack (app + dependencies + Vector + VictoriaLogs)

